<section id="features" class="lp-section">
    <div class="lp-head">
        <h2>Everything a small team needs</h2>
        <p>From the first hire to year-end forms, in one place.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-features">
        <div class="lp-feature"><i class="bi bi-calculator"></i><h3>Automatic payroll taxes</h3><p>Federal income tax, Social Security, Medicare, state withholding, FUTA and SUTA, worked out for every paycheck.</p></div>
        <div class="lp-feature"><i class="bi bi-bank"></i><h3>Direct deposit</h3><p>Split pay across accounts and download a NACHA ACH file for your bank. Paper checks work too.</p></div>
        <div class="lp-feature"><i class="bi bi-receipt"></i><h3>Pay stubs with your logo</h3><p>Every employee can view, print or save their pay stubs as PDF, with your company name and logo on top.</p></div>
        <div class="lp-feature"><i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i><h3>Time clock &amp; overtime</h3><p>Employees clock in and out from any device. Managers approve time, and overtime is calculated for you.</p></div>
        <div class="lp-feature"><i class="bi bi-sun"></i><h3>Time off &amp; holidays</h3><p>Vacation and sick-leave accruals, requests and approvals, and a company holiday calendar.</p></div>
        <div class="lp-feature"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-bar-graph"></i><h3>Reports &amp; year-end</h3><p>Payroll register, tax liability, Form 941 worksheet, W-2 and 1099 summaries. Export to CSV for your accountant.</p></div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="lp-section lp-steps-section">
