        <p>The <a href="help/company">company guide</a> walks you through each one with pictures.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-steps">
        <div><span class="num">1</span><h3>Register your company</h3><p>Name, state, your email and a password. That's it. You're the company's admin.</p></div>
        <div><span class="num">2</span><h3>Add your people</h3><p>Pay rates, W-4s and bank details. Invite each employee with their own login.</p></div>
        <div><span class="num">3</span><h3>Run payroll</h3><p>Calculate, review, approve, then mark it paid. Pay stubs appear for your team straight away.</p></div>
    </div>
</section>

